# CR 707.2 / 613.2a: Tilonalli's Skinshifter (0/1) attacks next to Hill Giant
# (3/3); its attack trigger makes it a copy of the Giant until end of turn, a
# Layer 1 copy effect. Grizzly Bears (2/2) blocks it: as a 3/3 copy it kills
# the Bears and survives 2 damage, where a 0/1 would have died. The unblocked
# Giant deals 3.
startturn human
advance 5
queue attackers 1,2
# The attack trigger targets Hill Giant (Id:2); advance does not resolve the
# stack, so resolvestack does.
queue targets 2
declareattackers
resolvestack
advance
queue blocks 3=1
declareblockers
advance
advance
combatdamage
# One more advance for the state-based-action check that moves the
# lethally damaged Bears to the graveyard.
advance
